ONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">전</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">·</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">후반기 시행</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">을 아래와 같이 실시하오니 학생들의 많은 참여 바랍니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">가</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">배경</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">육군은 육</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">,</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">해</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">,</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">공 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">3</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">군 본부가 위치한 계룡대를 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2011</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">년부터 전면 개방하여</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">‘</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">나라사랑 계룡대견학</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">’</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">체험 프로그램을 운영하고 있으며</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">이와 연계하여 학생들에게 나라사랑에 대한 순수한 창작활동의 기회를 제공하여 국가관 및 안보의식 함양을 위해 제</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">회</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">‘</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">나라사랑 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">UCC </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">공모전</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">’</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">을 아래와 같이 실시합니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">나</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">나라사랑 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang