: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">5) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">타인의 저작권 및 초상권 침해 소지가 있거나 유사 모방작품일 경우 심사대상에서 제외됩니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">6) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">자세한 사항은 육군 인사사령부 예비역협력과</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(042-550-7433, 6</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">∼</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">7) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">또는</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">나라사랑 계룡대 견학 홈페이지 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 10